  "scope": "World.Step only. Compact matching on tick 1; common translation and temporary same-direction chains; shared terrain tree, bounded local paths, queue recognition and target refinement. No frames/render/combat. 128-tick profiles have no tree build: they test dense motion and command cost. Max tick includes route preparation and may include first fallback JIT beyond warmup. Completion counter scans are outside Step timing. Calling-thread allocations only. One serial local run per profile, no concurrent graphical QA. Long 90000-tick run is a separate clean process from the same frozen Release build and includes idle tail after completion. Not directly comparable with historical maps/orders or a full RTS SLA.",
